{"id":"n74375-1-8","stage":2,"title":"재킷 · 外套","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74375-1-8-1","ko":"추우니까 재킷을 걸치고 나가렴.","zh":"天冷了，穿上夹克再出去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"추우니까","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재킷을","meaning":"外套","explanation":"재킷：外套；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재킷","audio":"/audio/0b76af4016ccfeb7e671.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74375","senseId":"1","lemma":"재킷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸치고","meaning":"披，披挂","explanation":"걸치다：披，披挂；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"걸치다","audio":"/audio/0d6f90903c248486b6a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16301","senseId":"5","lemma":"걸치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가렴.","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"0b76af4016ccfeb7","term":"재킷","zh":"外套","audio":"/audio/0b76af4016ccfeb7e671.mp3","entryId":"74375","definition":"前面分开的有袖子的短上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0d6f90903c248486","term":"걸치다","zh":"披，披挂","audio":"/audio/0d6f90903c248486b6a3.mp3","entryId":"16301","definition":"把衣服或饰物轻轻地穿或搭在身上。","pronunciation":["걸ː치다"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fbbf7aff876440667bfd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74375-1-8-2","ko":"네, 어머니.","zh":"好的，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。"